  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "BODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nGiven equation: 15 ÷ 36 - 18 + 0 × 25 = ?\n\n \n \n\n **Original Symbol**\n **New Symbol**\n \n \n\n **+**\n **×**\n \n \n\n **×**\n **+**\n \n \n\n **-**\n **÷**\n \n \n\n **÷**\n **-**\n \n \n\nNow, replacing the symbols:\n\n⇒ 15 - 36 ÷ 18 × 0 + 25 = ?\n\n⇒ 15 - __**36 ÷ 18**__ × 0 + 25 = ?\n\n⇒ 15 - __**2 × 0**__ + 25 = ?\n\n⇒ 15 - __**0**__ + 25 = ?\n\n⇒ __**15 - 0**__ + 25 = ?\n\n⇒ __**15 + 25**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**40**__.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
